::ALG1_U01_L01_Quiz_Q01::
[MA.912.NSO.1.1] Evaluate 49<sup>1/2</sup>. {
=7 #Correct.
~24.5 #Not quite. This treats the exponent as division.
~98 #Not quite. This treats the exponent as multiplication.
~2401 #Not quite. This squares instead of taking a root.
}

::ALG1_U01_L01_Quiz_Q02::
[MA.912.NSO.1.1] Evaluate 125<sup>1/3</sup>. {
~3 #Not quite. This confuses the root with the result.
=5 #Correct.
~15 #Not quite. This treats the expression as multiplication.
~375 #Not quite. This applies the exponent incorrectly.
}

::ALG1_U01_L01_Quiz_Q03::
[MA.912.NSO.1.1] Evaluate 64<sup>2/3</sup>. {
~4 #Not quite. Only the root was applied.
~8 #Not quite. Incorrect root or power applied.
=16 #Correct.
~32 #Not quite. The exponent was treated as multiplication.
}

::ALG1_U01_L01_Quiz_Q04::
[MA.912.NSO.1.1] Evaluate 81<sup>3/4</sup>. {
~3 #Not quite. Only the root was applied.
~9 #Not quite. Incorrect root used.
~243 #Not quite. The power was applied without the correct root.
=27 #Correct.
}

